17:/// write): a wedged binary (a shadowed `pbcopy` script, `xclip` blocking
18:/// on a dead `$DISPLAY`) must not hold the caller forever — the
19:/// `/provider export` flow gate stays shut while its write runs, so an
20:/// unbounded writer would no-op every later `/provider …` flow until the
