24:/// The effective platform id (`macos`/`linux`/`windows`): the explicit
25:/// [platform] pin wins (unit tests — the macOS/Windows paths are
26:/// unreachable on a Linux CI runner, which would push their CRAP through
27:/// the roof), else the host [Platform]. `null` = no pasteboard glue for
